9" end="01:23.086">words</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.211" end="01:27.321"><span begin="01:24.211" end="01:24.696">And </span><span begin="01:24.696" end="01:24.812">you're </span><span begin="01:24.812" end="01:25.331">on </span><span begin="01:25.331" end="01:25.476">the </span><span begin="01:25.476" end="01:25.981">way </span><span begin="01:25.981" end="01:27.317">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.627" end="01:30.807"><span begin="01:27.627" end="01:28.232">I </span><span begin="01:28.232" end="01:28.571">can't </span><span begin="01:28.571" end="01:28.931">wait </span><span begin="01:28.931" end="01:29.076">to </span><span begin="01:29.076" end="01:29.540">see </span><span begin="01:29.540" end="01:29.908">you </span><span begin="01:29.908" end="01:30.805">burn</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.029" end="01:34.973"><span begin="01:31.029" end="01:31.688">You </span><span begin="01:31.688" end="01:31.803">try </span><span begin="01:31.803" end="01:31.948">to </span><span begin="01:31.948" end="01:32.433">make </span><span begin="01:32.433" end="01:32.628">me </span><span begin="01:32.628" end="01:33.193">hate </span><span begin="01:33.193" end="01:33.568">that </span><span begin="01:33.568" end="01:34.966">girl</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.262" end="01:38.148"><span begin="01:35.262" end="01:35.768">When </span><span begin="01:35.768" end="01:36.133">I </span><span begin="01:36.133" end="01:36.373">should </span><span begin="01:36.373" end="01:36.528">be </span><span begin="01:36.528" end="01:37.193">hating </span><span begin="01:37.193" end="01:38.139">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.013" end="01:41.263"><span begin="01:39.013" end="01:39.413">What </span><span begin="01:39.413" end="01:39.638">the </span><span begin="01:39.638" end="01:39.925">hell's </span><span begin="01:39.925" end="01:40.245">wrong </span><span begin="01:40.245" end="01:40.523">with </span><span begin="01:40.523" end="01:41.259">you<